📊 Diwali Sales Analysis
📌 Project Overview

This project performs Exploratory Data Analysis (EDA) on Diwali sales data to identify customer purchasing behavior and business insights.

Using Python and data visualization libraries, this analysis explores:

Customer demographics
Purchase behavior
Sales trends
Product performance
Regional analysis

The goal is to understand which customer segments contribute most to sales during the Diwali season.

🚀 Features

✔ Data Cleaning and Preprocessing
✔ Handling Missing Values
✔ Data Type Conversion
✔ Exploratory Data Analysis (EDA)
✔ Visualizations using Matplotlib & Seaborn
✔ Customer Purchase Pattern Analysis

🛠 Tech Stack
Python
Pandas
NumPy
Matplotlib
Seaborn
Jupyter Notebook


