📥 Dataset

Dataset contains:

Gender
Age Group
State
Marital Status
Occupation
Orders
Amount
Product Category
🔍 Data Cleaning Steps
Removed unnecessary columns
Checked null values
Removed missing data
Converted Amount column datatype
Performed descriptive analysis

Example:

df.drop(['Status', 'unnamed1'], axis=1, inplace=True)
df.dropna(inplace=True)
df['Amount'] = df['Amount'].astype('int')


📈 Exploratory Data Analysis
Gender Analysis
Female customers contributed more to total sales.
Female purchasing power was higher than male customers.
Age Analysis
Majority of buyers belonged to 26–35 years age group.
State Analysis

Top contributing states:
Uttar Pradesh
Maharashtra
Karnataka
Marital Status Analysis
Married women contributed significantly to sales.
Occupation Analysis

Top customer occupations:
IT
Healthcare
Aviation
Product Category Analysis

Most sold categories:
Food
Clothing
Electronics

🏆 Key Insights
Married women aged 26–35 years
Customers from UP, Maharashtra, Karnataka
Working in IT, Healthcare, Aviation
Prefer purchasing:
Food
Clothing
Electronics


